  "source_findings": [
    "nvMapCreate requires page-aligned CPU address and size and power-of-two alignment; cache attribute call result not propagated at the inspected site",
    "nvMapClose returns void and does not propagate nvmap free or cache restoration results",
    "DkMemBlockMaker exposes storage pointer and dkFenceImport exists; these alone do not prove safe cross-engine memory sharing",
    "NvGraphicBuffer describes up to three planes with layout, pitch, offset and size",
    "oss-nvjpg surface allocator applies pitch and allocation alignment; exact constraints are donor-specific"
  ]
